{'symbol': 'CDAY', 'date': '2021-04-14 16:30:00', 'title': 'CERIDIAN TO ANNOUNCE FIRST QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS; PRESENTING AT UPCOMING INVESTOR CONFERENCES', 'text': 'TORONTO AND MINNEAPOLIS, APRIL 14, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CERIDIAN HCM HOLDING INC. (“CERIDIAN”) (NYSE:CDAY) (TSX:CDAY), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (“HCM”) SOFTWARE COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE DATE FOR THE RELEASE OF ITS FIRST QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS AND ITS PRESENTATIONS AT UPCOMING INVESTOR CONFERENCES.'}